                <mxCell id="10" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Grid board&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;o re%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bh1%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin-top%3A%200px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bcod%20QR%26lt%3B%2Fh1%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%26gt%3BCare%20sa%20seteze%20unele%20proprietati%20de%20tip%20descriptiv%20a%20ceea%20ce%20reprezinta%20gridul%20meu%20-%20scara%20sau%20interaxul%20default%20ale%20liniilor%20patratelelor%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22text%3Bhtml%3D1%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Boverflow%3Dhidden%3Brounded%3D0%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%22330%22%20width%3D%22180%22%20height%3D%22120%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="320" y="140" width="180" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="12" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;logica board&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;o retea de celule in care sa pot pune noduri de tip rooms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- edge-urile sunt default wall edges cu wall 25 simple, pe care sa pot adauga coduri QR care descriu noduri de tip window si doors, existente in presetari sau librarie.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Daca un nod de tip room este pus peste un edge, atunci acel room va fi construit din cele doua celule. - iar edge-ul wall este ignorat (devine sters ca logica)&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="550" y="60" width="200" height="340" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="13" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;noduri - documentatie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;practic trebuie sa descoperim minimul necesar de cod QR necesar sa mapam nodurile din graph editor pe o hartie si un mod de a citi acel cod dintr-o poza si sa il transformam inapoin in graph. Aplicatia ar trebui sa converteasca apoi graph-ul in geometrie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Noduri specializate de care avem nevoie - node de tip eraser - care daca il pun pe un edge wall, acesta este ignorat la transformarea inapoi in graph.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="560" y="400" width="450" height="340" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="14" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;colturile grid-ului&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;Acestea vor fi axis nodes - cod qr eventual inclus, cu numerotarea lor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;valoarea default - has column true si asa mai departe - dar cumva doar sa mapam&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Aceasta logica o putem eventual pune intr-un cod QR in coltul board-ului, daca se poate implementa - lasand grid-ul doar desenat geometric.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="70" y="340" width="450" height="340" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
